er), beta (aluminium), gamma (lead)."},{"j":"p","t":"Half-life: time for half the nuclei to decay."}]},{"id":"f3-sains-dlp-9","nama":"9. Space Weather and Space Exploration","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Space"},{"j":"p","t":"Solar wind, sunspots and flares affect Earth; the magnetosphere protects us."},{"j":"p","t":"Sputnik 1 (1957), Gagarin (1961), Armstrong (1969), Malaysian astronaut (2007)."}]},{"id":"f3-sains-dlp-u1","nama":"End-of-Year Test (sample)","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Sample test"},{"j":"p","t":"36 questions from every chapter: easy to hard. Suggested time: 1 hour."}]}]}